    "description": {
      "value": "Trigger: A creature in range Strides.\n\nYou surround a moving creature with lifelike illusions, shifting their perception of the terrain to subtly lead them off course. The target must attempt a Will save.\n\nRegardless of the result, the creature is immune to lose the path for 1 hour.\n\nSuccess: The creature is unaffected.\nFailure: The creature treats all squares as 3 for its Stride.\nCritical Failure: As failure, except that you determine where the target moves during the Stride, though you can't move it into hazardous terrain or to a place it can't stand."
    },
